  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Emily can peel:\n\n\\[\n7\\text{ shrimp/minute}\\times 10\\text{ minutes}=70\\text{ shrimp}.\n\\]\n\nSince 100 shrimp are available, the supply is sufficient. Therefore, Emily can peel and sauté\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{70}\n\\]\n\nshrimp.",
    "Emily can peel:\n\n\\[\n6\\text{ shrimp/minute}\\times 10\\text{ minutes}=60\\text{ shrimp}.\n\\]\n\nSince 100 shrimp are available, she can peel and sauté:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{60}\n\\]",
